                "text": "As the Trump administration looks to improve the efficiency of the nation\u2019s health programs, I want to make sure Mississippi is able to maintain and grow its already significant medical research capabilities.\n\nThis hearing was useful and informative \u2013 we will use this testimony as a guide in developing biomedical and medical research funding bills this year.\n\nhttps://t.co/JX95wACPuJ",
