                "text": "Had the privilege of meeting with dedicated Mississippi advocates from the Alzheimer\u2019s Association and Alzheimer\u2019s Impact Movement today. We talked about advancing research and public health infrastructure to best support those affected by Alzheimer\u2019s. I am committed to fighting this devastating disease and stand alongside all who are affected in Mississippi and across the country.",
