                "retweet_count": 25,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I was honored to welcome USDA @SecRollins to @msstate to spotlight our farm economy and the growing need for veterinarians in rural areas. We toured MSU\u2019s top-tier facilities and discussed how this challenge directly affects animal health, food production, and rural economies. I\u2019m grateful to Sec. Rollins for making the time to see the important work being done here. Also appreciate the students, Dr. Keenum, Dr. Frank, and Mike McCormick @MSFarmBureau for their hospitality and contributions to this important conversation. Food security is national security.",
