                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I applaud @SecRollins and @usda for making important changes to strengthen our veterinary workforce. As a cattle producer and co-chair of the Senate Veterinary Medicine Caucus, I know how urgently rural areas need more veterinary support. This announcement shows real commitment to protecting animal health and supporting our American farmers. Food security is national security, and this is exactly the kind of leadership we need.",
