                "text": "It was great meeting today with Mississippi heart health experts on Capitol Hill. We talked about tackling high blood pressure, improving rural care, saving lives, and advancing efforts to improve health outcomes across Mississippi and the nation. I\u2019m proud to lead the bipartisan effort to recognize National Cholesterol Education Month, because knowing your numbers can truly make a life-saving difference.\n\n@ACCinTouch",
