                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Proud to join my colleagues in urging HHS and CMS to protect the conscience rights of medical residents in graduate education programs. We recently sent a letter to Secretary Kennedy and Administrator Oz to ensure that these rights are respected while keeping training available for those who choose it. Not only is this what our conscience protection laws are meant to do, but this approach will also encourage more medical students to go into the OB/GYN specialty, helping address critical maternity care shortages across the country.\n\nMore details on the letter: https://t.co/5fHtQSG4nY",
